## Stage 3 — MVP Scoping

### What to Build
- Build the ONE thing that proves the core hypothesis
- A working demo is non-negotiable in the current era (AI tools remove all excuses)
- Non-technical founders must use AI tools (v0, Cursor, Replit, etc.) to ship something real
- "Coming soon" landing pages do not count as demos

### MVP Checklist
- [ ] Core user action is completable end-to-end
- [ ] On-chain interaction is visible and meaningful (not cosmetic)
- [ ] Works on mainnet or devnet with real wallet connection
- [ ] Can be demoed live in under 2 minutes
- [ ] Has at least 1 real user who is not a friend or family member

### Iteration Tempo
Ship → show to users → get feedback → ship again. Do this loop as many times as possible before the deadline. Speed of iteration is itself a signal judges look for.

